        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-600-1/TrustworthinessCharacteristicEnum#PRIVACY_ENHANCED>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-600-1/TrustworthinessCharacteristicEnum#SAFE>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-600-1/TrustworthinessCharacteristicEnum#SECURE_AND_RESILIENT>,
